{"id":"vol8-07","section":4,"path":"bank/listening/vol8-07/audio-4.m4a","model":"small","duration":349.02,"segments":[{"start":0.0,"end":7.18,"text":"Part 4. You will hear part of a landscape design lecture about the health benefits of","words":[["Part",0.0,0.34],["4.",0.34,0.86],["You",1.8,2.38],["will",2.38,2.54],["hear",2.54,2.8],["part",2.8,3.12],["of",3.12,3.28],["a",3.28,3.44],["landscape",3.44,3.94],["design",3.94,4.54],["lecture",4.54,5.0],["about",5.0,5.76],["the",5.76,6.02],["health",6.02,6.28],["benefits",6.28,6.78],["of",6.78,7.18]]},{"start":7.18,"end":65.35,"text":"gardens in hospitals. First, you have some time to look at questions 31 to 40. Now,","words":[["gardens",7.18,7.64],["in",7.64,8.14],["hospitals.",8.14,8.72],["First,",10.14,10.9],["you",11.08,11.14],["have",11.14,11.32],["some",11.32,11.52],["time",11.52,11.92],["to",11.92,12.24],["look",12.24,12.36],["at",12.36,12.52],["questions",12.52,12.82],["31",12.82,13.68],["to",13.68,13.96],["40.",13.96,14.34],["Now,",65.01,65.35]]},{"start":65.41,"end":74.99,"text":"listen carefully and answer questions 31 to 40. Welcome to today's lecture about hospital gardens","words":[["listen",65.41,65.73],["carefully",65.73,66.19],["and",66.19,66.57],["answer",66.57,67.01],["questions",67.01,67.43],["31",67.43,68.31],["to",68.31,68.57],["40.",68.57,68.95],["Welcome",72.13,72.73],["to",72.73,72.99],["today's",72.99,73.41],["lecture",73.41,73.67],["about",73.67,74.17],["hospital",74.17,74.55],["gardens",74.55,74.99]]},{"start":74.99,"end":80.31,"text":"and their medical benefits. Recently, a group of architects were interviewed about healthcare","words":[["and",74.99,75.33],["their",75.33,75.47],["medical",75.47,75.75],["benefits.",75.75,76.17],["Recently,",77.13,77.59],["a",77.97,78.13],["group",78.13,78.25],["of",78.25,78.41],["architects",78.41,78.79],["were",78.79,79.11],["interviewed",79.11,79.49],["about",79.49,79.87],["healthcare",79.87,80.31]]},{"start":80.31,"end":86.11,"text":"facilities. 82% of them agreed that the planning of outdoor space should be one","words":[["facilities.",80.31,80.79],["82",82.07,82.57],["%",82.57,83.09],["of",83.09,83.33],["them",83.33,83.47],["agreed",83.47,83.81],["that",83.81,84.13],["the",84.13,84.27],["planning",84.27,84.63],["of",84.63,84.83],["outdoor",84.83,85.19],["space",85.19,85.63],["should",85.63,85.85],["be",85.85,85.97],["one",85.97,86.11]]},{"start":86.11,"end":91.57,"text":"of the most important considerations in the design of hospitals. Of course, the","words":[["of",86.11,86.23],["the",86.23,86.31],["most",86.31,86.49],["important",86.49,87.03],["considerations",87.03,87.67],["in",87.67,88.09],["the",88.09,88.17],["design",88.17,88.59],["of",88.59,88.71],["hospitals.",88.71,89.15],["Of",90.15,90.61],["course,",90.61,90.93],["the",91.47,91.57]]},{"start":91.57,"end":96.83,"text":"idea that a garden can be good for our health is not exactly new, but a 1984","words":[["idea",91.57,91.97],["that",91.97,92.17],["a",92.17,92.29],["garden",92.29,92.55],["can",92.55,92.83],["be",92.83,92.97],["good",92.97,93.15],["for",93.15,93.31],["our",93.31,93.49],["health",93.49,93.91],["is",93.91,94.43],["not",94.43,94.61],["exactly",94.61,95.09],["new,",95.09,95.45],["but",95.71,96.19],["a",96.19,96.33],["1984",96.33,96.83]]},{"start":96.83,"end":101.67,"text":"study by an environmental psychologist Roger Schwartz was the first to use","words":[["study",96.83,97.53],["by",97.53,97.89],["an",97.89,98.01],["environmental",98.01,98.45],["psychologist",98.45,99.37],["Roger",99.37,99.75],["Schwartz",99.75,100.27],["was",100.27,100.95],["the",100.95,101.09],["first",101.09,101.31],["to",101.31,101.51],["use",101.51,101.67]]},{"start":101.67,"end":105.77,"text":"the standards of modern medical research to demonstrate that gardens can","words":[["the",101.67,101.83],["standards",101.83,102.15],["of",102.15,102.43],["modern",102.43,102.83],["medical",102.83,103.19],["research",103.19,103.73],["to",103.73,104.31],["demonstrate",104.31,104.71],["that",104.71,105.11],["gardens",105.11,105.49],["can",105.49,105.77]]},{"start":105.77,"end":107.83,"text":"and sometimes speed recovery from surgery","words":[["and",105.77,105.87],["sometimes",105.87,106.21],["speed",106.21,106.59],["recovery",106.59,107.05],["from",107.05,107.37],["surgery",107.37,107.83]]},{"start":108.15,"end":110.17,"text":"and also help the healing of infection.","words":[["and",108.15,108.49],["also",108.49,108.77],["help",108.77,109.07],["the",109.07,109.27],["healing",109.27,109.53],["of",109.53,109.71],["infection.",109.71,110.17]]},{"start":111.65,"end":114.69,"text":"In his study, Schwartz reviewed the medical records","words":[["In",111.65,112.01],["his",112.01,112.17],["study,",112.17,112.61],["Schwartz",112.91,113.09],["reviewed",113.09,113.53],["the",113.53,113.95],["medical",113.95,114.23],["records",114.23,114.69]]},{"start":114.69,"end":117.61,"text":"of people recovering from surgery at a suburban hospital.","words":[["of",114.69,114.89],["people",114.89,115.17],["recovering",115.17,115.61],["from",115.61,115.85],["surgery",115.85,116.37],["at",116.37,116.65],["a",116.65,116.73],["suburban",116.73,117.07],["hospital.",117.07,117.61]]},{"start":118.63,"end":120.07,"text":"All other things being equal,","words":[["All",118.63,118.95],["other",118.95,119.13],["things",119.13,119.39],["being",119.39,119.67],["equal,",119.67,120.07]]},{"start":120.47,"end":123.43,"text":"patients with bedside windows looking out on leafy trees","words":[["patients",120.47,120.75],["with",120.75,121.03],["bedside",121.03,121.41],["windows",121.41,121.87],["looking",121.87,122.25],["out",122.25,122.55],["on",122.55,122.71],["leafy",122.71,123.05],["trees",123.05,123.43]]},{"start":123.91,"end":127.49,"text":"healed on average a day faster than those looking at a wall","words":[["healed",123.91,124.25],["on",124.25,124.61],["average",124.61,124.99],["a",124.99,125.43],["day",125.43,125.67],["faster",125.67,126.11],["than",126.11,126.33],["those",126.33,126.57],["looking",126.57,126.87],["at",126.87,127.03],["a",127.03,127.13],["wall",127.13,127.49]]},{"start":127.89,"end":130.63,"text":"and they needed significantly less pain medication","words":[["and",127.89,128.23],["they",128.23,128.41],["needed",128.41,128.71],["significantly",128.71,129.29],["less",129.29,129.79],["pain",129.79,130.09],["medication",130.09,130.63]]},{"start":130.87,"end":133.45,"text":"and had fewer complications after their surgery.","words":[["and",130.87,131.21],["had",131.21,131.37],["fewer",131.37,131.63],["complications",131.63,132.31],["after",132.31,132.83],["their",132.83,133.03],["surgery.",133.03,133.45]]},{"start":134.53,"end":140.37,"text":"In fact, at the time, studies carried out in Europe showed that the conditions in hospital","words":[["In",134.53,135.19],["fact,",135.19,135.53],["at",135.99,136.23],["the",136.23,136.33],["time,",136.33,136.75],["studies",137.03,137.41],["carried",137.41,137.75],["out",137.75,137.97],["in",137.97,138.13],["Europe",138.13,138.39],["showed",138.39,139.03],["that",139.03,139.25],["the",139.25,139.35],["conditions",139.35,139.79],["in",139.79,140.05],["hospital",140.05,140.37]]},{"start":140.37,"end":142.75,"text":"can have serious physical consequences.","words":[["can",140.37,140.83],["have",140.83,141.03],["serious",141.03,141.53],["physical",141.53,142.07],["consequences.",142.07,142.75]]},{"start":143.75,"end":147.69,"text":"These studies showed that hospitals contributed to people's levels of stress.","words":[["These",143.75,144.25],["studies",144.25,144.59],["showed",144.59,144.99],["that",144.99,145.15],["hospitals",145.15,145.63],["contributed",145.63,146.17],["to",146.17,146.47],["people's",146.47,146.91],["levels",146.91,147.11],["of",147.11,147.31],["stress.",147.31,147.69]]},{"start":148.87,"end":154.83,"text":"Fortunately, as the evidence implicating hospitals increased, the amount of data suggesting","words":[["Fortunately,",148.87,149.53],["as",150.35,150.53],["the",150.53,150.65],["evidence",150.65,150.93],["implicating",150.93,151.71],["hospitals",151.71,152.05],["increased,",152.05,152.65],["the",153.47,153.55],["amount",153.55,153.81],["of",153.81,153.97],["data",153.97,154.19],["suggesting",154.19,154.83]]},{"start":154.83,"end":157.13,"text":"that gardens can encourage healing grew too.","words":[["that",154.83,155.09],["gardens",155.09,155.37],["can",155.37,155.61],["encourage",155.61,155.99],["healing",155.99,156.33],["grew",156.33,156.71],["too.",156.71,157.13]]},{"start":157.85,"end":161.71,"text":"According to various studies of healthy people, just three to five minutes spent","words":[["According",157.85,158.23],["to",158.23,158.47],["various",158.47,158.77],["studies",158.77,159.09],["of",159.09,159.29],["healthy",159.29,159.55],["people,",159.55,159.91],["just",160.19,160.31],["three",160.31,160.59],["to",160.59,160.71],["five",160.71,160.97],["minutes",160.97,161.29],["spent",161.29,161.71]]},{"start":161.71,"end":168.67,"text":"looking at views of trees, flowers or water, can begin to reduce anger and pain and to increase","words":[["looking",161.71,162.03],["at",162.03,162.25],["views",162.25,162.55],["of",162.55,162.77],["trees,",162.77,163.19],["flowers",163.59,164.11],["or",164.11,164.39],["water,",164.39,164.77],["can",165.03,165.41],["begin",165.41,165.67],["to",165.67,165.93],["reduce",165.93,166.19],["anger",166.19,166.75],["and",166.75,167.07],["pain",167.07,167.45],["and",167.45,168.19],["to",168.19,168.33],["increase",168.33,168.67]]},{"start":168.67,"end":175.51,"text":"relaxation. This is shown in physiological changes in electrical activity, most obviously in the heart.","words":[["relaxation.",168.67,169.33],["This",170.35,170.55],["is",170.55,170.69],["shown",170.69,171.03],["in",171.03,171.27],["physiological",171.27,171.77],["changes",171.77,172.41],["in",172.41,172.65],["electrical",172.65,173.03],["activity,",173.03,173.67],["most",173.97,174.21],["obviously",174.21,174.67],["in",174.67,175.07],["the",175.07,175.19],["heart.",175.19,175.51]]},{"start":176.47,"end":181.73,"text":"Now, it's important for me to state clearly that gardens can't cure you, but there's good evidence","words":[["Now,",176.47,176.75],["it's",177.11,177.37],["important",177.37,177.69],["for",177.69,177.95],["me",177.95,178.07],["to",178.07,178.21],["state",178.21,178.39],["clearly",178.39,178.75],["that",178.75,179.01],["gardens",179.01,179.29],["can't",179.29,179.77],["cure",179.77,179.95],["you,",179.95,180.27],["but",180.59,180.85],["there's",180.85,181.07],["good",181.07,181.21],["evidence",181.21,181.73]]},{"start":181.73,"end":187.31,"text":"they can reduce your levels of pain and by doing that boost your immune system in ways that help","words":[["they",181.73,182.01],["can",182.01,182.19],["reduce",182.19,182.51],["your",182.51,182.75],["levels",182.75,183.03],["of",183.03,183.23],["pain",183.23,183.63],["and",183.63,184.29],["by",184.29,184.43],["doing",184.43,184.63],["that",184.63,184.95],["boost",184.95,185.23],["your",185.23,185.45],["immune",185.45,185.83],["system",185.83,186.31],["in",186.31,186.73],["ways",186.73,186.95],["that",186.95,187.15],["help",187.15,187.31]]},{"start":187.31,"end":197.72,"text":"you heal. Importantly, as research into this field has grown, it has shown that not all","words":[["you",187.31,187.51],["heal.",187.51,187.79],["Importantly,",192.98,193.66],["as",194.02,194.18],["research",194.18,194.58],["into",194.58,195.0],["this",195.0,195.26],["field",195.26,195.5],["has",195.5,195.68],["grown,",195.68,196.02],["it",196.52,196.6],["has",196.6,196.7],["shown",196.7,197.06],["that",197.06,197.28],["not",197.28,197.44],["all",197.44,197.72]]},{"start":197.72,"end":204.84,"text":"gardens are equally effective in the healing process. In 1995 Marcus Cooper and landscape","words":[["gardens",197.72,198.04],["are",198.04,198.38],["equally",198.38,198.82],["effective",198.82,199.4],["in",199.4,199.62],["the",199.62,199.72],["healing",199.72,199.94],["process.",199.94,200.42],["In",201.54,201.72],["1995",201.72,202.48],["Marcus",202.48,203.4],["Cooper",203.4,203.78],["and",203.78,204.42],["landscape",204.42,204.84]]},{"start":204.84,"end":210.44,"text":"architect Mark Bennett analysed the physical layout of several hospital gardens and carried","words":[["architect",204.84,205.26],["Mark",205.26,205.68],["Bennett",205.68,206.02],["analysed",206.02,207.22],["the",207.22,207.3],["physical",207.3,207.68],["layout",207.68,208.12],["of",208.12,208.42],["several",208.42,208.72],["hospital",208.72,209.06],["gardens",209.06,209.5],["and",209.5,210.1],["carried",210.1,210.44]]},{"start":210.44,"end":215.8,"text":"out observations of their daily use. They then conducted interviews with the people","words":[["out",210.44,210.62],["observations",210.62,211.1],["of",211.1,211.44],["their",211.44,211.58],["daily",211.58,211.92],["use.",211.92,212.36],["They",213.32,213.54],["then",213.54,213.76],["conducted",213.76,214.22],["interviews",214.22,214.82],["with",214.82,215.36],["the",215.36,215.52],["people",215.52,215.8]]},{"start":215.8,"end":220.42,"text":"who use the gardens and they discovered that the users mostly visited gardens looking","words":[["who",215.8,216.06],["use",216.06,216.34],["the",216.34,216.46],["gardens",216.46,216.84],["and",216.84,217.48],["they",217.48,217.6],["discovered",217.6,218.02],["that",218.02,218.34],["the",218.34,218.48],["users",218.48,218.8],["mostly",218.8,219.22],["visited",219.22,219.72],["gardens",219.72,220.14],["looking",220.14,220.42]]},{"start":220.42,"end":223.56,"text":"to relax and recover from mental and physical tiredness.","words":[["to",220.42,220.66],["relax",220.66,220.98],["and",220.98,221.3],["recover",221.3,221.7],["from",221.7,221.96],["mental",221.96,222.32],["and",222.32,222.5],["physical",222.5,222.8],["tiredness.",222.8,223.56]]},{"start":224.28,"end":226.46,"text":"They also found that what people liked most","words":[["They",224.28,224.64],["also",224.64,224.88],["found",224.88,225.24],["that",225.24,225.36],["what",225.36,225.52],["people",225.52,225.84],["liked",225.84,226.14],["most",226.14,226.46]]},{"start":226.46,"end":228.52,"text":"were gardens that had a fountain.","words":[["were",226.46,227.02],["gardens",227.02,227.32],["that",227.32,227.58],["had",227.58,227.86],["a",227.86,228.16],["fountain.",228.16,228.52]]},{"start":229.76,"end":232.28,"text":"These results are consistent with Schwartz's findings","words":[["These",229.76,230.1],["results",230.1,230.52],["are",230.52,230.7],["consistent",230.7,231.14],["with",231.14,231.4],["Schwartz's",231.4,231.88],["findings",231.88,232.28]]},{"start":232.28,"end":234.4,"text":"of the healing power of a window view","words":[["of",232.28,232.54],["the",232.54,232.66],["healing",232.66,232.94],["power",232.94,233.38],["of",233.38,233.58],["a",233.58,233.68],["window",233.68,234.0],["view",234.0,234.4]]},{"start":234.4,"end":238.54,"text":"and also correspond with the theories of evolutionary biologists","words":[["and",234.4,235.22],["also",235.22,235.56],["correspond",235.56,236.02],["with",236.02,236.44],["the",236.44,236.58],["theories",236.58,236.9],["of",236.9,237.12],["evolutionary",237.12,237.68],["biologists",237.68,238.54]]},{"start":238.54,"end":241.56,"text":"that people prefer views that are similar to the fields","words":[["that",238.54,239.16],["people",239.16,239.46],["prefer",239.46,239.76],["views",239.76,240.16],["that",240.16,240.38],["are",240.38,240.5],["similar",240.5,240.82],["to",240.82,241.06],["the",241.06,241.18],["fields",241.18,241.56]]},{"start":241.56,"end":242.54,"text":"where humans evolved.","words":[["where",241.56,241.74],["humans",241.74,242.04],["evolved.",242.04,242.54]]},{"start":243.8,"end":247.02,"text":"What you can do in the gardens is important as what you see.","words":[["What",243.8,244.24],["you",244.24,244.38],["can",244.38,244.58],["do",244.58,244.88],["in",244.88,245.12],["the",245.12,245.22],["gardens",245.22,245.5],["is",245.5,245.74],["important",245.74,246.12],["as",246.12,246.34],["what",246.34,246.5],["you",246.5,246.7],["see.",246.7,247.02]]},{"start":247.02,"end":252.34,"text":"study. The results of behavioural map studies in which researchers observe visitors' actions","words":[["study.",247.02,247.12],["The",247.7,248.2],["results",248.2,248.48],["of",248.48,248.72],["behavioural",248.72,249.26],["map",249.26,249.48],["studies",249.48,249.9],["in",249.9,250.4],["which",250.4,250.58],["researchers",250.58,250.94],["observe",250.94,251.52],["visitors'",251.52,251.78],["actions",252.04,252.34]]},{"start":252.34,"end":258.34,"text":"while in a garden suggested gardens need several different things to be effective. They need","words":[["while",252.34,252.76],["in",252.76,252.92],["a",252.92,253.02],["garden",253.02,253.32],["suggested",253.32,253.94],["gardens",253.94,254.52],["need",254.52,255.0],["several",255.0,255.58],["different",255.58,255.86],["things",255.86,256.26],["to",256.26,256.44],["be",256.44,256.56],["effective.",256.56,256.96],["They",257.94,258.18],["need",258.18,258.34]]},{"start":258.34,"end":263.6,"text":"to provide areas for private conversations, flat, shady paths that people would like","words":[["to",258.34,258.48],["provide",258.48,258.74],["areas",258.74,259.24],["for",259.24,259.42],["private",259.42,259.76],["conversations,",259.76,260.44],["flat,",261.0,261.48],["shady",261.8,262.0],["paths",262.0,262.56],["that",262.56,262.98],["people",262.98,263.22],["would",263.22,263.4],["like",263.4,263.6]]},{"start":263.6,"end":268.0,"text":"to walk along and that won't trip wheelchairs. That's important in hospitals.","words":[["to",263.6,263.78],["walk",263.78,264.0],["along",264.0,264.3],["and",264.3,265.02],["that",265.02,265.14],["won't",265.14,265.4],["trip",265.4,265.6],["wheelchairs.",265.6,266.24],["That's",266.86,267.14],["important",267.14,267.48],["in",267.48,267.64],["hospitals.",267.64,268.0]]},{"start":269.38,"end":273.24,"text":"Another thing that res