lue the same things in gardens,","words":[["and",291.1,291.4],["it's",291.4,291.58],["been",291.58,291.76],["found",291.76,292.24],["that",292.24,292.7],["while",292.7,292.9],["different",292.9,293.3],["generations",293.3,293.96],["seem",293.96,294.32],["to",294.32,294.48],["value",294.48,294.76],["the",294.76,294.98],["same",294.98,295.2],["things",295.2,295.52],["in",295.52,295.7],["gardens,",295.7,296.02]]},{"start":296.54,"end":299.16,"text":"some differences in preferences have turned up too.","words":[["some",296.54,296.8],["differences",296.8,297.28],["in",297.28,297.6],["preferences",297.6,297.98],["have",297.98,298.38],["turned",298.38,298.68],["up",298.68,298.92],["too.",298.92,299.16]]},{"start":299.86,"end":305.66,"text":"Middle-aged adults look for peace and quiet, while older adults are more likely to seek stimulation.","words":[["Middle",299.86,300.48],["-aged",300.48,300.78],["adults",300.78,301.34],["look",301.34,301.56],["for",301.56,301.72],["peace",301.72,301.98],["and",301.98,302.12],["quiet,",302.12,302.44],["while",302.74,303.12],["older",303.12,303.56],["adults",303.56,303.96],["are",303.96,304.1],["more",304.1,304.26],["likely",304.26,304.6],["to",304.6,304.78],["seek",304.78,305.02],["stimulation.",305.02,305.66]]},{"start":306.54,"end":314.14,"text":"At one residence for seniors, the researchers noticed that every afternoon the elderly residents would sit at the front of the building","words":[["At",306.54,307.12],["one",307.12,307.34],["residence",307.34,307.7],["for",307.7,308.0],["seniors,",308.0,308.28],["the",308.8,308.84],["researchers",308.84,309.22],["noticed",309.22,309.66],["that",309.66,310.26],["every",310.26,310.68],["afternoon",310.68,311.32],["the",311.32,311.64],["elderly",311.64,311.98],["residents",311.98,312.46],["would",312.46,312.72],["sit",312.72,313.04],["at",313.04,313.22],["the",313.22,313.3],["front",313.3,313.56],["of",313.56,313.72],["the",313.72,313.8],["building",313.8,314.14]]},{"start":314.14,"end":318.58,"t